455 euros, was awarded in November 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts near the legal limit does not prove improper actions. It could reflect market conditions or budget constraints. Statistical trends alone do not indicate wrongdoing without further investigation.\nWhat can be checked: Check the distribution of contracts across different sectors to see if they align with the body's needs. Review the terms of contract [1] to ensure compliance with legal thresholds. Assess if multiple contracts serve the same purpose to identify potential inefficiencies.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"obras","citas":["iCDbpGNvOZ1Vq4S9zvaQpQ%3D%3D","8xxoGELMP8YS7pcxhTeWOg%3D%3D","a3SL3mNnQGQzjChw4z%2FXvw%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}